<view class="notice offline" wx:if="{{online === false}}" role="status" aria-live="polite">网络连接已断开，请检查网络。未确认的操作请保留并重试。</view>
<view class="notice recovery" wx:elif="{{recovered}}" role="status"><text>网络已恢复，可手动重试未完成的操作。</text><button class="notice-action button-motion {{buttonMotionStates['b1']}}" bindtap="onDismiss" aria-label="关闭网络恢复提示" hover-class="button-motion-hover" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="0"
  data-motion-key="{{'b1'}}"
  data-motion-disabled="{{false}}"
  bindtouchstart="onButtonPressStart"
  bindtouchend="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindtouchcancel="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindanimationend="onButtonPressAnimationEnd"
>知道了</button></view>
<view class="notice" wx:if="{{update === 'ready'}}" role="status"><text>新版本已准备好</text><button class="notice-action button-motion {{buttonMotionStates['b2']}}" bindtap="onUpdate" hover-class="button-motion-hover" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="0"
  data-motion-key="{{'b2'}}"
  data-motion-disabled="{{false}}"
  bindtouchstart="onButtonPressStart"
  bindtouchend="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindtouchcancel="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindanimationend="onButtonPressAnimationEnd"
>更新</button></view>
<view class="home-entry" wx:if="{{homeEntry && !hideHome}}"><button bindtap="onHome" class="button-motion {{buttonMotionStates['b3']}}" hover-class="button-motion-hover" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="0"
  data-motion-key="{{'b3'}}"
  data-motion-disabled="{{false}}"
  bindtouchstart="onButtonPressStart"
  bindtouchend="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindtouchcancel="onButtonPressRelease"
  bindanimationend="onButtonPressAnimationEnd"
>回到首页</button></view>
